000010* Class conditions (NUMERIC, ALPHABETIC, ...) on items cobc
000020* does not test inline: packed, groups, function results.
000030 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000040 PROGRAM-ID. CLASSTST.
000050 DATA DIVISION.
000060 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000070 01 X PIC X(5) VALUE "12A45".
000080 01 P PIC S9(5) COMP-3 VALUE -123.
000090 01 G.
000100    05 G1 PIC X(3) VALUE "123".
000110 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
